# The PIXL engine binding is a private package on GitHub Packages.
# Only the scope → registry mapping lives here. pnpm (12+) does not expand
# ${ENV} placeholders in a project .npmrc, so the auth token is supplied
# through the user-level config instead:
#   locally:  pnpm config set //npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken <PAT with read:packages>
#             (or per command: env "npm_config_//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=$TOKEN" pnpm install)
#   in CI:    actions/setup-node writes it from NODE_AUTH_TOKEN (the PACKAGES_TOKEN secret).
@xuckless:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
